<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS0.Px3" title="In 5.2 Main Results ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Can Post-Training Turn LLMs into Good Medical Coders? An Empirical Study of Generative ICD Coding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold">PHI</span> refines the remaining missed-code cases.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS0.Px4" title="In 5.2 Main Results ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Can Post-Training Turn LLMs into Good Medical Coders? An Empirical Study of Generative ICD Coding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Post-trained LLMs narrow the gap to PLM-ICD.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
